WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
THE CUSTOMER’S EQUIPMENT
Calibration history, recall dates and the records behind each instrument.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:28.000
CALIBRATION + MEASUREMENT EVIDENCE
As-found and as-left readings, uncertainty, TUR, standards and decision rules.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:44.000
DOCUMENT CREATOR
Author a certificate, minimize the register, then open the rendered PDF and print.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
THE RENDERED CERTIFICATE
Print preview of the real backend output: measurement results, uncertainty and traceability.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
ASSET LIGHT
Give the customer an overview of equipment, work, certificates and scheduled pickups.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
WORKFLOW AUTOMATION
Define actions and decisions on the canvas. Inspect the path the work takes.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.000
PICKUP + DELIVERY
Keep the map, stop sequence, driver assignment and route records together.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:26.000
SIGMA REPORTS
Compare work across laboratories and keep the contributing records in view.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:34.000
QUALITY MANAGEMENT
Follow findings, corrective actions, certificate queues and affected work.

